# M0 runs without environment variables, accounts or API keys.
# You do not need to copy this file to start the application.
# When a later milestone needs configuration, create .env.local in the
# project root. It is ignored by Git. Never paste secrets into chat.
# Never prefix a database URL or server secret with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
#
# Optional Node hosting setting (set in your host or terminal, not needed here):
# PORT=3000
#
# Database/Auth variables will be documented when implemented in M1.
# No placeholder credentials or unused future-service keys are required in M0.
